match: receipt email
think 1.5
say A plain template, so it renders the same in every mail client.
tool Write src/checkout/receiptEmail.ts
add export const receiptEmail = (o: Order) => `Thanks, ${o.name}! Order ${o.id}: ${o.total}`;
sh mkdir -p src/checkout && printf 'export const receiptEmail = (o: { id: string; name: string; total: string }) =>\n  `Thanks, ${o.name}! Your order ${o.id} (${o.total}) is on its way.`;\n' > src/checkout/receiptEmail.ts
think 4
tool Bash npm run typecheck
out no errors
say Receipt email added.
done
